{
    "title": "PixelPhrase \u2122 Pics & Word Game",
    "description": "Ready for a word-guessing challenge?\r\nPixelPhrase \u2122 Pics & Word Game is here to elevate your experience! Forget the easy 4 pics or 2 pictures riddles and now guess the word from just one image. Challenge yourself with the ultimate 1 pic 1 word puzzle that will blow your mind!\r\n\r\nThis word-brain game offers hundreds of levels to play with stunning, eye-catching images created by artificial intelligence. Guess the word\u2014it could be your favorite person, an iconic movie, a renowned celebrity, or any adorable animal. It might even be your country\u2019s flag, a fun emoji, or a logo you love! Enjoy daily challenges that will leave your mind blown as you test your knowledge in this exciting word game.\r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\nGuess the word from the pic! Each level features a unique AI picture, and you need to type the correct word to solve the puzzle.\r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n- Milk bottles shaking hands? The word is \"milkshake.\"\r\n- A worm in a book? The word is \"bookworm.\"\r\n\r\nChallenge your skills and enjoy hundreds of exciting levels in this pic-to-word game!\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n1 - Unique chapters featuring themed image puzzles.\r\n2 - Hundreds of unique images with new ones added regularly.\r\n3 - Perfect for both adults and kids.\r\n4 - Pics-based challenges that test your word-guessing skills.\r\n5 - Use power-ups to reveal letters, disable unused letters, and get hints when you\u2019re stuck.\r\n\r\nChallenge your friends with these pic word riddles that offer four times the fun with their unique puzzles, and become the top word-guessing master!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ready for a word-guessing challenge?<br>PixelPhrase \u2122 Pics &amp; Word Game is here to elevate your experience! Forget the easy 4 pics or 2 pictures riddles and now guess the word from just one image. Challenge yourself with the ultimate 1 pic 1 word puzzle that will blow your mind!<br><br>This word-brain game offers hundreds of levels to play with stunning, eye-catching images created by artificial intelligence. Guess the word\u2014it could be your favorite person, an iconic movie, a renowned celebrity, or any adorable animal. It might even be your country\u2019s flag, a fun emoji, or a logo you love! Enjoy daily challenges that will leave your mind blown as you test your knowledge in this exciting word game.<br><br>How to Play:<br>Guess the word from the pic! Each level features a unique AI picture, and you need to type the correct word to solve the puzzle.<br><br>For example:<br>- Milk bottles shaking hands? The word is &quot;milkshake.&quot;<br>- A worm in a book? The word is &quot;bookworm.&quot;<br><br>Challenge your skills and enjoy hundreds of exciting levels in this pic-to-word game!<br><br>Game Features:<br>1 - Unique chapters featuring themed image puzzles.<br>2 - Hundreds of unique images with new ones added regularly.<br>3 - Perfect for both adults and kids.<br>4 - Pics-based challenges that test your word-guessing skills.<br>5 - Use power-ups to reveal letters, disable unused letters, and get hints when you\u2019re stuck.<br><br>Challenge your friends with these pic word riddles that offer four times the fun with their unique puzzles, and become the top word-guessing master!",
